### Analyze the manual timetable change
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/schedule/session/impact
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./manual_change_impact.json

### Analyze a cross-day change to compare both affected faculty days
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/schedule/session/impact
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./manual_change_impact_cross_day.json
